id: pm-rust-cross-operation-journal
title: "BLOCKING: recover pending journals before a different native mutation writes"
description: "PR 104 blocking durability defect, independently reproduced by interrupting our native process at a write boundary in a scratch tracker. Interrupt native update at rename ordinal 1, then comment succeeds while runtime/transactions/update-<id>.json remains; returning to update exits 2 RecoveryConflict. The analogous comment to update sequence is tested too. Snapshot runtime intent, recover all applicable journals before any item mutation, preserve original history, and verify cross-runtime evidence before removing this blocker. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/104 . Separate from first-fsync gate recovery in PR 105."
